  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two particles with charges <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{2}\"></span> are separated by a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5\"></span> m. Point P lies on the straight line joining <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{2}\"></span>, at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The electric field at P is zero. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Q_{1}}{Q_{2}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{5-x}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5-x}{x}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x^{2}}{(5-x)^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{(5-x)^{2}}{x^{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
